# Implementation Plan - System Enhancements & Security Fixes

Addressing critical schema gaps, security risks in bulk imports, and missing administrative/management features.

## Proposed Changes

### [Database] Schema Migrations
Update the Prisma schema to support better data tracking and security.

#### [MODIFY] [schema.prisma](file:///c:/Users/vaibh/Documents/Ayur-stock%20pro/prisma/schema.prisma)
- **Medicine**: Add `mrp` and `tradePrice` (Decimal, default 0).
- **ImportJob**: Add `shopId` (String, default "").
- **Relation Verification**: Ensure all new fields have appropriate defaults to prevent migration issues.

### [API] Security & Tracking
Update existing APIs to respect the new schema fields and security constraints.

#### [MODIFY] [Import Routes]
- Update [app/api/medicines/import/batch/route.ts](file:///c:/Users/vaibh/Documents/Ayur-stock%20pro/app/api/medicines/import/batch/route.ts) (or relevant import creation route) to include `shopId`.
- Update [app/api/medicines/import/status/[jobId]/route.ts](file:///c:/Users/vaibh/Documents/Ayur-stock%20pro/app/api/medicines/import/status/%5BjobId%5D/route.ts) to filter by `shopId`.

#### [NEW] [Admin APIs]
- **Activity Log**: `/api/admin/activity-log` (Paginated, filtered by shop).
- **AI Usage**: `/api/admin/ai-usage` (Aggregated statistics from `ApiUsageCounter`).
- **Login History**: `/api/admin/login-history` (Filtered by shop).

### [Frontend] Settings Enhancements
Add the requested administrative tabs.

#### [NEW] [Tabs Components]
- `components/settings/activity-log-tab.tsx`
- `components/settings/ai-usage-tab.tsx`
- `components/settings/login-history-tab.tsx`

#### [MODIFY] [Settings Page](file:///c:/Users/vaibh/Documents/Ayur-stock%20pro/app/dashboard/settings/page.tsx)
- Integrate the new tabs for `ADMIN` users.

### [Frontend] Supplier Management
Replace the placeholder with a full CRUD implementation.

#### [NEW] [Suppliers Page](file:///c:/Users/vaibh/Documents/Ayur-stock%20pro/app/dashboard/suppliers/page.tsx)
- Implementation of Supplier list, create, edit, and delete.
- Integration with Purchases to show supplier-specific history.

## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
- `npx prisma db push` & `npx prisma generate`.
- `npm run lint` & `npm run build`.

### Manual Verification
- Verify medicine pricing fields appear in the UI and DB.
- Confirm `ImportJob` records are correctly scoped to shops.
- Test all three new settings tabs with mock data.
- Perform full CRUD on a Supplier and check purchase history.
